{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天想通知您一个更新：课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前知道实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道，我们一直用的低延迟。这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播延迟约5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播成本通常更高。您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "我们用的Web控制台。那低延迟直播的费用怎么算？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本高于标准直播。如果您之前配置了学员课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟直播也可使用该费用。需要我指导您查看或配置吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那怎么配置？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "在Web控制台的课程发布页面，选择直播类型时勾选低延迟直播即可。如果看不到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需通过验证或同步提示。还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "notified", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s02_not_aware", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天想跟您同步一个课程发布页面的更新。我们新增了“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前知道这个变化吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "不知道啊，之前不是只有一个直播选项吗？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，之前后台统一配置的是低延迟链路。现在您可以在发布页面根据课程场景选择。标准直播延迟约5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动更好，适合小班课或实操课。费用上低延迟会高一些。您之前实际使用的是低延迟链路，您清楚吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "哦，原来是这样。那我现在发布课程时怎么选？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程呢？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我用Web控制台。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，在Web控制台的课程发布页面，您会看到直播类型选项，选择“低延迟直播”即可。如果暂时没看到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系我们确认。另外，如果您的学员使用课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟直播也可以配置同样的费用，您需要我指导设置路径吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "费用方面我还不确定，先不用了。后续有通知吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示。请问还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "informed", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s03_compare_cost", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天联系您是想通知您，课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道。那这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那低延迟直播是不是更贵？贵多少？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，低延迟直播成本确实更高，具体价格因用量而异，但通常比标准直播贵一些。不过，如果您的课程需要实时互动，低延迟直播能提供更好的体验。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我们主要上大班课，标准直播够用了吧？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，标准直播延迟稍高，但成本低，适合大班课。您可以根据课程场景灵活选择，发布流程不变。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "那我们在Web控制台发布课程，能看到这两个选项吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "Web控制台应该会显示这两个选项。如果暂时看不到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认即可。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那第三方系统比如校验系统A能看到吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "如果使用第三方系统，可以进入“我的”页面，找到直播平台设置，在产品配置中勾选低延迟直播。标准直播默认可用。"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "我们学员用课包抵扣直播费用，低延迟直播也能用课包吗？"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "可以，如果已经配置了课包抵扣，低延迟直播也适用。您可以在费用配置页编辑低延迟直播对应费用后保存。"}, {"turn": 16, "role": "user", "content": "那配置路径是什么？"}, {"turn": 17, "role": "agent", "content": "进入费用配置页面，找到低延迟直播选项，设置费用后保存即可。如果不确定，可以联系平台客服指导。"}, {"turn": 18, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我明白了。还有其他通知吗？"}, {"turn": 19, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示。如果没有其他问题，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}, {"turn": 20, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 16, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 17, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 18, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 19, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 20, "task_status": "explained", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_004", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s04_compare_latency", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天想跟您同步一个课程发布页面的更新。我们新增了“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前发布课程时，后台是统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道，之前都是低延迟的。那这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播延迟约5-10秒，成本较低，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。如果课程需要实时互动，建议选择低延迟直播。费用上，低延迟直播因为链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那发布流程会变吗？我怕老师们不习惯。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "发布流程完全不变，只是在发布页面多了一个选择，老师可以根据课程场景选标准或低延迟。另外，您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我们主要用Web控制台。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，在Web控制台的课程发布页面，您应该能看到新增的直播类型选项。如果暂时看不到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认即可。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "那低延迟直播的费用，能用学员课包抵扣吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "可以，如果已经配置了学员课包抵扣或直播链路费用，低延迟直播也能使用。您可以在费用配置页编辑低延迟直播对应的费用后保存。需要我指导具体路径吗？"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "不用了，我回头自己看看。还有其他要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示一下。如果还有其他问题，随时联系我们。祝您工作顺利！"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "explained", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_005", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s05_web_visible", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天联系您是想通知您，课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，我知道，之前是后台配置的。那这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。您是通过Web控制台发布课程吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我用Web控制台。但我现在看不到低延迟直播的选项啊？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "别担心，可能是后台配置未完全同步。请您先刷新一下页面，如果还是看不到，可能是权限问题，您可以联系平台确认。另外，您是否使用学员课包抵扣或直播链路费用配置？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "有的，我们用了学员课包抵扣。那低延迟直播也能用这个费用吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，低延迟直播也可以配置该费用。您可以在费用配置页编辑低延迟直播对应费用后保存。如果找不到入口，可以进入“我的”页面，找到直播平台设置，在产品配置中勾选低延迟直播。后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示。还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "guided", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s06_system_visible", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，今天联系您是想通知您，课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个独立选项，原有发布流程不变。您之前实际使用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，您知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道，我们一直用低延迟的。那这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。低延迟直播链路和节点保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "明白了。那发布流程会变吗？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "发布流程不变，只是在发布页面新增两个可选择的直播类型，您可以根据课程场景选择。请问您是通过Web控制台、校验系统A还是SaaS系统B发布课程？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "我们用的是SaaS系统B。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的。在SaaS系统B中，您可以进入“我的”页面，找到直播平台或课程平台设置，选择直播平台后，在产品配置中勾选低延迟直播。如果暂时看不到，可能是后台配置未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认。您能操作一下看看吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我试试……嗯，看到了，有低延迟直播的选项。那费用方面呢？我们之前用学员课包抵扣直播链路费用，低延迟直播也能用吗？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "如果已经配置了相关费用，低延迟直播也可以使用该费用。如无法确认，可以进入费用配置页，编辑低延迟直播对应费用后保存。需要我指导具体路径吗？"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，你再说一遍路径，我记一下。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，您先进入“我的”页面，找到“费用配置”或“直播费用”选项，然后选择低延迟直播，编辑费用后保存即可。如果找不到，可以联系平台客服。后续我们也会通过企业微信发送通知，您需要验证或同步提示。还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "guided", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_a2469c8033e9", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_007", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s07_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我正在上课，请简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，打扰了。我们课程发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原有流程不变。您之前实际使用的是低延迟链路。标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本低；低延迟直播1-2秒，互动好，成本稍高。建议需要实时互动时选低延迟直播。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我知道了。我现在很忙，能不能稍后再联系？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "没问题，我稍后给您回访。请问您方便什么时间？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "下午3点以后吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记下了。后续我们也会通过企业微信发送通知，请留意。那就不打扰您上课了，祝您工作顺利！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "preferred_time": "2025-03-21 15:00"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
